        ("We are away for months. Can you handle it without us there?", "Usually, as long as someone can let us onto the property and clear us at the guardhouse. A house manager, contractor or neighbor can meet us. We send photos of the hive and the repair, and an itemized invoice on request, so you can see the work from wherever you are."),
        ("There are bees in a palm at the Beach Pavilion. Who handles that?", "The beach, the pavilion and the town parks are town property, and Public Works maintains the trees there. Tell Town Hall or the beach attendants first. If a colony is on your own lot next to the beach, that one is yours, and we can take it out alive."),
